        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles in this Sudoku are truly unique. The algorithm to make the puzzles has been worked on for months and your enjoyment of new Sudoku puzzles is guaranteed as you play the game.<br><br>There is a challenge mode and a retro soundtrack to enjoy while playing the game.<br><br>You can pick between multiple difficulties, if you're new to Sudoku and want a simpler challenge at first, try the easy setting.<br><br>This game is great for quick Sudoku puzzle solving in between things or while in transit. You can mute the music to listen to your own soundtracks while playing the game, or you can skip to your favourite song.<br><br>The soundtrack has 20 different tracks for you to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you have some fun and enjoy the puzzles! If you leave a review and I'll do my best to improve the game.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles in this Sudoku are truly unique. The algorithm to make the puzzles has been worked on for months and your enjoyment of new Sudoku puzzles is guaranteed as you play the game.<br><br>There is a challenge mode and a retro soundtrack to enjoy while playing the game.<br><br>You can pick between multiple difficulties, if you're new to Sudoku and want a simpler challenge at first, try the easy setting.<br><br>This game is great for quick Sudoku puzzle solving in between things or while in transit. You can mute the music to listen to your own soundtracks while playing the game, or you can skip to your favourite song.<br><br>The soundtrack has 20 different tracks for you to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you have some fun and enjoy the puzzles! If you leave a review and I'll do my best to improve the game.</p>",
        "short_description": "Antero Sudoku is a true random Sudoku puzzle game featuring a challenge mode and cool tunes. Challenge mode progress is saved on device. No ads, no in-app purchases or DLCs. You can play this game offline and it's got some easter egg effects if you click on things. I hope you enjoy the music!",
